g sympathy or or care for those  people who are going through a version  of what he went through  public campaign events raise all of  those questions again  and keep this center stage which is an  issue he doesn't want at the center of  his re-election campaign yeah and as we  pointed out john no evidence of contact  tracing  by the white house yet at all thank you  john dickerson we appreciate it

